    {
      "text": "Clean fish fillets and cut into 8 thin pieces. Place on a kitchen towel to dry.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m4AoZdkiF44CjKunF4KL9AdZmqU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/284340-Posh-Fish-Fingers-DDMFS-Step-2-6a7371a914c14ffabe239383dadd0054.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/284340/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour and bread crumbs in two separate bowls. Divide bouillon powder and parsley between the 2 bowls and mix to combine.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qxIQpplLZmpTiKGDuVZS4gAaOBM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/284340-Posh-Fish-Fingers-DDMFS-Step-3-3a85185c549c4e57a369089f3806ed2d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/284340/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs with a fork in a third bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zzmT3ldg4rQzx6O7IONlaAdzOeE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/284340-Posh-Fish-Fingers-DDMFS-Step-4-0f587ad2b3e34ffea226ce25c52b25bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/284340/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip fish into the flour, then into the egg wash, and finally dust lightly in bread crumbs. Place on a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CqfYFQWAX9aDC0w0war7w6Hguw8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/284340-Posh-Fish-Fingers-DDMFS-Step-5-768d6b2503c44195af29e47bbdbed3a3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/284340/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat sunflower oil in a frying pan over medium heat. Gently add fish to the hot oil and fry until golden brown, about 1 1/2 minutes. Flip and repeat on the other side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hKliJ8QWOmiFT5XiXf3iwnhsOg0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/284340-Posh-Fish-Fingers-DDMFS-Step-6-fa4e2af364fc4ae5b8566b0f7b0cf546.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/284340/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain on a paper towel-lined plate.",
